    "body": "`docker_context` module is disabled default.([Configuration \\| Starship](https://starship.rs/config/#docker-context))\r\n\r\nI think it works if you change it as follows.\r\n```\r\n[character]\r\nsymbol = \"›\"\r\n\r\n[docker_context]\r\nsymbol = \"🐋 \"\r\ndisabled = false\r\n\r\n[package]\r\nsymbol = \"🎁 \"\r\n```",
